MODULE: RefusalNotChargedRearmChargesUndelivered
TARGET: RefusalNotCharged
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the next pass charges a touch that was never delivered
PERTURBS: PassRearm

--- FIND
        !.attempts = IF @ = 2 THEN 0 ELSE @]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: pass rearm spends an undelivered consumer's budget.
        !.attempts = IF @ = 2 THEN 0 ELSE @ + 1]]
--- END
